  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "はい！\r\nということでね、今晩は──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "新曲のコーラス部分を歌ってくれた、\r\nアンティーカの月岡恋鐘さんに来ていただいてます！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "拍手～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0209",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00486",
    "fg": "004861",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よろしくお願いします～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 796,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 2
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "いやあ、月岡さんのコーラス、本当最高だった\r\nこの番組に寄せられたお便りの中にもね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "『明るさと、情念が伝わってきました』\r\n『切なくて健気なだけじゃない何かを、感じました』",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "こんな感想が来てるんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ……\r\nそうなんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "この『何か』については、俺たちも感じてたんだよ\r\nでも、話し合ってもうまく言語化できなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "月岡さんはコーラスを歌う時、\r\nいったいどんなイメージを持ってたんだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "『あの人のところに、白く美しい雪が降りますように』\r\nって歌詞、うち、ばり好きやったとです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そん部分のこと、なしてうちは好いとうとかな、とか\r\nこの子、どがんこと考えとるんやろ、って思って……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "うんうん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……もしかしたら",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "『自分の恋もあの人の恋も全部、\r\n白く美しい雪の下に眠らせられたらいい』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そがん気持ちのあるのかもしれん、って考えたとです",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "なるほどね……\r\n複雑な恋心だ～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "月岡さんは、\r\n恋ってそういう側面があると思うんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ちょっとだけいつもと違う自分になる、\r\nそいが恋かもしれん……そがん思いました",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "わかるよ、好きな相手が好意に気付かなかったりすると\r\n俺も相手がちょっと憎くなったりするもん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "……いやあ、ほんと月岡さんに歌ってもらえて良かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "いろいろ考えてくれたおかげで、\r\n俺たちの曲に味わいが出たと思います",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "とんでもなかです～！\r\nよか曲、よかボーカルあってのことやと思いますけん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "っふふ……ありがとね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ボーカル兼リーダー",
    "text": "じゃあ、今夜の一曲目は新曲をかけちゃいましょう！\r\n月岡さんのコーラスも、よーく聴いてね──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
