  {
    "id": 2004016110120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よか仕事やった～、プロデューサー！\r\nこがんとははじめてやったけど、ばり面白かったばい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、恋鐘が喜んでくれてよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきラジオで言ってた言葉は、\r\nちょっと意外だったけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～、そう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ばってんうちは──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "『好きな人への気持ちを眠らせてしまいたい』とか、\r\nそがん気持ちは持てんね～って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "曲ば聴きながら、考えとったと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘は、誰かに恋をしてるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "しとるよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "相手はいったい……\r\nいや……俺が訊いていいことじゃないかもしれないが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016110200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ……\r\nうちはね、ファンのみんなに恋ばしとるとよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401611/2004016110200"
  },
